{title: Dil Dhoondta Hai (Slow)}
{artist: Bhupinder Singh Madan Mohan}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D]dil dhundata data hai,
[A]phir wahi fursat ke raat din
[A]baithe [D]rahe tasawwoor-ye-jana [G]kiye huye
[D]jaadon ki narma [G]dhup aur aangan [A]me let kar
[D]aankho pe khinch [G]kar tere aanchal [A]ke saaye ko
[A]aundhe pade [D]rahe kabhee [G]karawat liye huye
[D]yaa gamreeyon [G]kee raat [A]jo purawaiyan chale
[D]thhandee safed [G]chaadaro pe [A]jaage der tak
[A]taaron ko [D]dekhate rahe chhat [G]par pade huye
[D]barfeeli sardiyon [G]me kisi [A]bhi pahaad par
[D]waadi me [G]gunjati huyi [A]khamoshiyan sune
[A]aankho me [D]bheeege bhige se [G]lamhe liye huye
